  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Infection Prevention and Control for improved quality health care in Tajikistan (Health Development Programme Component 3)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;(UNICEF) The action aims to achieve effective infection prevention and control (IPC) system at the primary and secondary health care delivery levels and to contribute to enhancing the capacity of the Government of Tajikistan for effective COVID-19 crisis response.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
